    "content": "@CoreFX DLSS 5 Neural Rendering\n\nYesterday, a binary of a DLSS 5 got leaked into the internet, and good fellas from RenoDX community made it compatible with any game that supports DLSS 5 Neural Rendering in any game\n\nResults in GTA 5 Enhanced with CoreFX. If this is not a photorealism, then what this is?\n\nWe will not implement DLSS 5 Neural Rendering in our CoreFX RenoDX addon, and you will need to find a leaked binary yourself. And you need a RTX series card. But it's worth it, trust me.",
